            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ben-adad ocoko mony pa jo Ciria i dog oro, ci gutiro i Apek pi lweny ki jo Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo Icrael bene guryeyo monygi, ci gutiŋo mony i kom jo Ciria, ma guyubbe ki camgi bene. Jo Icrael guyubo gonygi i nyim lumerokgi macalo lwak dyegi manok ma gipokogi i dul aryo ‘keken, ento jo Ciria gupoŋo lobo woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dano pa Lubaŋa dok obino cok ci owaco bot kabaka me Icrael ni, “Rwot owaco kuman ni, Pien jo Ciria gubedo ka waco ni, ‘Rwot en Iubana me godi, pe lubaŋa me nota-gu,’ en aye lok mumiyo abimiyo monygi madit-ti i ciŋi, ci ibiŋeyo atir ni an aye a Rwot.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mony aryo ducu gugony gukemme ki mony pa lumerokgi pi nino abiro kulu, ci lweny ocakke i nino me abirone. Jo Icrael guneko askari pa jo Ciria ma giwoto ki tyengi ma romo alip miya acel kulu i kom nino meno acel-lu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo mudoŋŋe guriŋo gularo gaŋ Apek, ci cel murumo gaŋ dok opoto i kom jo mapol ma gudoŋŋe ma giromo alip pyeraryo wiye abiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ben-adad bene oriŋo kunnu, odonyo i kicika ma i tyelo ot mo ma i gaŋ kunnu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luticce guwacce ni, “Nen ba, watyeko winyo ni luker ma i ot ker me Icrael gin lukica. Wek koŋ waruk boŋo cola i pyerwa ki tol-gu ma watweyo i wiwa wacit kwede bote en kabaka me Icrael, ci gwok nyo en pe bineki.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gutweyo pyergi ki boŋo cola, ki tol i wigi ducu, gucito kwede bot kabaka me Icrael. Guwaco bote ni, “Laticci Ben-adad owacci, ebako doge boti ber iweke, pe doŋ ineke.” Kabaka ogamo ni, “En pud tye makwo bo? En omera.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onoŋo jo-nu gitye ka yenyo Lanyut mo wek guniaŋ kit ma piny tye kwede. Ka guwinyo nyiŋ man, “omera”, ci gugamo oyotoyot ni, “Iyo, omeru Ben-adad.” En dok owacci, “Wucit wukele.” Ben-adad obino bote, ci kabaka Akab otine i gadigadine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ben-adad owacce ni, “Gaŋi ma yam wora oyako ki, bot woru abidwokogi ducu i ciŋi: ka dok in bene itwero bedo ki dukani me cato wil i Damaciko kit ma yam wora obedo kwede i Camaria.” Akab ogamo ni, “Abibwoti icito pi lok ma iciko-ni.” Kit meno oketo gicikke kwede, ci obwote ocito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laco mo ma i kin lwak pa lunebi owaco bot lawote ni, “Amito igoya malit,” kun Rwot aye onoŋo ocike kumeno. Ento lawote okwero goye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.13.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Luker 13.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok owacce ni, “In pe iworo lok pa Rwot. Pi meno, nen ba, ka ce ibia ki bota kombeddi, labwor mo bineki woko cut.” Ka dano meno oa woko ki bote, ci labwor orwatte kwede, oneke woko cut, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lanebi dok onoŋo dano mukene, owaco bote ni, “Amito igoya malit,” ci laco meno otugi goye cut, ogoye oketo ret i kome bene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lanebi-nu ocito, obedo ka kuro kabaka Akab i ŋet yo, kun oloko kit kome woko pi umo waŋe woko ki kitambara ma otweyo iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kabaka obekato, odaŋŋe bote kun wacci, “An laticci acito i mony, ci adonyo wa i dyere ka ma lweny tye malyet. Ci nen, askari mo odwogo ki dano mo ma okelo bota ci ocika ni, ‘Gwokka dano man. Ka ce iweko orwenyo woko pi tyen lok mo, ci in aye ibito ma kakare, nyo ibiculo ki talanta acel me ryal.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kit meno, kit ma abedo ka yelle kany ki kuca-ni, ladit, omiyo en ocito gire woko.” Kabaka me Icrael owacce ni, “Gibiŋolo koppi kit meno; in kikomi aye ityeko ŋolone.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dano-nu okwanyo kitambara woko oyotoyot ki i waŋe, ci kabaka otugi ŋeyo cut ni en ŋat acel i kin lunebi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dano-nu owaco bot kabaka ni, “Rwot owaco kuman ni, Pien in ityeko bwoto dano ma onoŋo an aciko ni myero ginek woko, pienno gibineko in ma kakare, gibineko lwakki bene ma ka lwakke.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka me Icrael odok gaŋ, oo i Camaria ki toncwiny ma wane oballe woko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
